                                                "sense_id": "93a37171-9f68-3289-98d3-3f6e87a21abc",
                                                "text": "His car's motor is bleeding smoking down the motorway."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4fa533a-dd38-4dfc-99c1-394a2d96136d",
                                                "sense_id": "93a37171-9f68-3289-98d3-3f6e87a21abc",
                                                "text": "It turns out he was too bleeding cheap to ever drain the oil."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56b55661-cade-438a-95eb-2f4ed5db084f",
                                                "sense_id": "93a37171-9f68-3289-98d3-3f6e87a21abc",
                                                "text": "It does highlight some of the difficulties, but does not dare state the bleeding obvious, which is that neither are likely to play a major part in delivering a decarbonised agenda on the railways – […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
